		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Corpse covered in a skein of thick, ropey blue veins. Hapless victims of an akata.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 10, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +1 (1d6) and 1 tongue (1d6 + drain), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> -2, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Drain</strong>. Attach to target, tongue auto-hits next round. STR 9+ on turn to remove.</p><p></p><p><strong>Relentless</strong>. If zombie reduced to 0 HP by a non-magical source, CON 15+ to go to 1 HP instead.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
